# The binary is COPIED here by the build script, never committed. Doctrine 134
# of `.kiro/specs/multi-raft-performance/`: ship the binary, do not rebuild it —
# a container that rebuilt would fold a different compiler and a different
# dependency resolution into the very delta the tier exists to isolate.
*
!.gitignore
